exports[`preserves update summary requests and restored context 1`] = `
[
  {
    "cacheRetention": "none",
    "context": {
      "messages": [
        {
          "content": "You are a context summarization assistant. Your task is to read a conversation between a user and an AI assistant, then produce a structured summary following the exact format specified.

Do NOT continue the conversation. Do NOT respond to any questions in the conversation. ONLY output the structured summary.",
          "role": "system",
          "timestamp": 0,
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "<conversation>
[User]: synthetic work

[Assistant thinking]: synthetic reasoning

[Assistant]: working

[Assistant tool calls]: tools.call(name="workspace.read", input={"path":"note.txt"})

[Tool result]: 

[... 20 more characters truncated]
</conversation>

<previous-summary>
previous synthetic summary
</previous-summary>

The messages above are NEW conversation messages to incorporate into the existing summary provided in <previous-summary> tags.

Update the existing structured summary. Preserve previous facts, add new progress and decisions, move completed work to Done, and update Next Steps. Preserve exact conversation IDs, task ownership, pending work, tool names, arguments, results, paths and error messages. Remove a prior fact only if it is no longer relevant. Use the same format as the previous summary.",
              "type": "text",
            },
          ],
          "role": "user",
          "timestamp": 0,
        },
      ],
    },
    "maxTokens": 1000,
  },
]
`;

